                <div class="mb-5">
                    <h3 class="fw-black mb-3">Professional Biography</h3>
                    <div class="lh-lg small text-black-50 se-style-95a59c">
                        <p class="mb-3">
                            <strong>Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan</strong> is a corporate professional registered under the Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA), Government of India. Holding the unique <strong>Director Identification Number (DIN) / Partner Identification Number (DPIN) 06382177</strong>, they serve as a critical signatory authority, overseeing and steering a diverse portfolio of corporate ventures. With a verified track record in the Indian corporate ecosystem, Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan has been instrumental in executing strategic corporate governance and compliance operations.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mb-3">
                            Currently, Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan is actively associated as a partner or designated partner with <strong>3</strong> registered <strong>Limited Liability Partnerships (LLPs)</strong> in India. These entities operate across multiple key sectors of the national economy. In their capacity as a designated partner, Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan maintains full accountability for legal compliance, regulatory reporting, and financial transparency obligations mandated under the Limited Liability Partnership Act of India.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            The portfolio of companies associated with Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan includes directors:
                            
                            <strong>Shantee Homes Realty Llp</strong> (appointed on 27-02-2014 as a Director), 
                            
                            <strong>Shantee Global Realty Llp</strong> (appointed on 02-05-2023 as a Director), 
                            
                            <strong>Saffronscape Homemakers Llp</strong> (appointed on 02-05-2023 as a Director)
                            .
                            All appointments are validated against the latest registry updates, showing active compliance standing. The comprehensive record of corporate filings, registered addresses, and historical partner networks is maintained with daily synchronizations.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                
